    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 學寫字"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《學寫字》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/南風</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhWcpGWc1fStBCaPoYKrKtroI0VbVcCv4BLFBRuscevSyWHlfqiwhECsxwjifRNx5xT5gUzc5psTVc0aDs7YuDJU1bhrxq_SLfJ9BGXXCD49R5lmr5EiDZ24fvtTt83SPf8aaUoq3qTbGOmOtYYe8ID-edFV0sefglyTLgBH94D8rhncisthuRMA0fQFD59\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhWcpGWc1fStBCaPoYKrKtroI0VbVcCv4BLFBRuscevSyWHlfqiwhECsxwjifRNx5xT5gUzc5psTVc0aDs7YuDJU1bhrxq_SLfJ9BGXXCD49R5lmr5EiDZ24fvtTt83SPf8aaUoq3qTbGOmOtYYe8ID-edFV0sefglyTLgBH94D8rhncisthuRMA0fQFD59=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">食到40 thóng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsiah tann beh學寫字</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">「阿爸、阿母」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">華語mā lóng有</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">M̄-koh</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">「定定（tiānn-tiānn）」m̄是「常常」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">「雄雄」kah「熊」無tī代</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Huah「gâu早」m̄是猴起了siunn早</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">人ē-sái「無去」　buē-sái「無--去」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">教冊20冬</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">教囡仔寫字</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsit-má suah不時hōo人kā我問</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">你án-ne寫kám tio̍h？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">台語kám有字？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">阮阿公ē-hiáu講台語　哪ē看lóng無？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div>我kan-na知影</div><div>阮阿公講台語　寫日本字</div><div>Lín講ê『國語』m̄是伊ê「國語」</div><div>Tsit个國m̄是伊beh愛ê國</div><div>我kan-na知影</div><div>我iáu ē講、ē聽</div><div>Tsín beh來學寫：</div><div><br /></div><div>諺語　涼傘雖破，骨格原在</div><div>諺語　番薯m̄驚落塗爛</div><div><br /></div><div>愛　副詞　需要、定著</div><div>愛　動詞　kah意</div><div>愛　動詞　想beh做某一件代誌</div><div><br /></div><div>我愛寫字</div><div>我愛寫……</div><div>我愛……</div><div><br /></div><div><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class